msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"All right, forget about that one, then...\r\n"
"Your next target is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "(Who's that guy? I can't hear what they're saying...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "(Now they're splitting up. What should I do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Hey! You're one of the old targets!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "I'm done with you already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Hey! Hold up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Damn..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "(Guess I'll have to go after that guy with the glasses.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "(I'll follow him for a while.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Nnngh... What kinda monster are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Why'd you say I was a target?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Hey, I'm just doin' my job, man. They showed me your picture\r\n"
"and told me to chase you out of Kamurocho, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"If you wouldn't listen to a \"polite\" request, then I was\r\n"
"supposed to do whatever it took to get rid of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"If I'd known you were such a badass, I never woulda taken\r\n"
"this job in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Hey! Don't go yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Damn..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "(No use standing around here. I better check in with Emi.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Hey. Why the hell're you following me? You some kinda\r\n"
"sick bastard cruising for ass?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "(Dammit. He spotted me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Wait a second... You're the target! Heh! This job's too\r\n"
"easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Job? What job?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"I'll ask you nicely just this once. Leave Kamurocho and\r\n"
"don't come back, or I'll make you regret it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"Not gonna play nice? I didn't think so! In that case,\r\n"
"there's only one thing left to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "...tear you a new asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "(Dammit. I lost him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "(I better check in with Emi.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Talk to the tall man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "Follow the man with glasses."
msgstr ""

